  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Martin Tilma ( m dot tilma at func dot nl ) reported this to fedora-commons-users on Feb 4th, 2010:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Hello,",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I have an issue with with fedora 3.3 after sending a few wrong",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "findObject webservice requests. Fedora seems to block when you send a",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "lot of \"wrong\" requests.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The request:",
       "type": "text"
