    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It is complaining about the \"?\" in the value when using a Equals",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Condition. (to fix this you have to escape the \"?\" with a slash \"?\")",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The response seems valid and correct to me. But after sending a lot",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "requests (using soap-ui with 5 threads running for one minute) fedora",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "stops responding and the requests will time out.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
